    "title": "Charges filed against former Shoshone County sheriff - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By JOSH McDONALD ,\n9 hours ago WALLACE — Former Shoshone County Sheriff Holly Lindsey has been charged with inattentive driving, a misdemeanor under Idaho law. Court clerks confirmed that while the Idaho Attorney General’s Office has not filed a probable cause affidavit, a criminal complaint was submitted. According to the complaint, the charge stems from an Oct. 21 incident in which Lindsey allegedly struck a post at the Osburn 76 gas station while driving her personal vehicle. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
